But this one says, hey, Josh, I'm sending you this message from France.
但这个人说，嘿，乔什，我从法国给你发了这条消息。

00:56:16.840 --> 00:56:22.679
I don't know if you really love being recognized as Ted Mosby, but today I want to talk to you about it.
我不知道你是否真的喜欢被称为 Ted Mosby，但今天我想和你谈谈这个问题。

00:56:22.679 --> 00:56:31.713
I need to talk to you about it because tonight for the third time I finished how I met your mother and for the third time I cried a lot.
我需要和你谈谈这件事，因为今晚我第三次讲完我是如何遇见你母亲的，第三次我哭了很多。

00:56:31.713 --> 00:56:37.159
I'm 17 and I really grew up watching this series And I mean in every way possible.
我今年 17 岁，我真的是看着这个系列长大的，我的意思是在所有可能的方面。

00:56:37.159 --> 00:56:45.599
I went through a lot of very bad times and you were always there to make me laugh and believe again, you were there to instruct me really important things about life.
我经历了很多非常糟糕的时光，你总是在那里让我开怀大笑，让我再次相信，你在那里指导我关于生活的真正重要的事情。

00:56:45.599 --> 00:56:47.599
Every episode had something to teach me.
每一集都有一些东西可以教给我。

00:56:47.599 --> 00:56:52.960
Like, I just like your character believe a lot in destiny, maybe too much.
就像，我只是喜欢你的性格，相信命运，也许太多了。

00:56:52.960 --> 00:56:54.199
I love too much.
我太爱了。

00:56:54.199 --> 00:56:56.239
I do everything too much.
我做的一切都太多了。

00:56:56.239 --> 00:56:59.440
And sometimes I'm worrying if I shouldn't just stop.
有时我会担心我是否不应该停下来。

00:56:59.440 --> 00:57:06.579
But thanks to how I met your mother, I'll never worry again because this is me and I'm never gonna change.
但多亏了我认识你母亲的方式，我再也不会担心了，因为这就是我，我永远不会改变。

00:57:06.579 --> 00:57:08.460
I'll still be me forever.
我永远还是我。

00:57:08.460 --> 00:57:12.860
So what I wanna say is a big thank you, Josh, for everything.
所以我想说的是，非常感谢乔什，为我所做的一切。

00:57:12.860 --> 00:57:16.940
By the way, I listened to your songs and they are legend, wait for it, Derry.
顺便说一句，我听过你的歌曲，它们都是传奇，等等，德里。

00:57:16.940 --> 00:57:18.579
So that's awesome.
所以这太棒了。

00:57:18.579 --> 00:57:19.699
Alec picked that one.
亚历克选了那个。

00:57:19.699 --> 00:57:24.500
I don't want it to seem like I was like, let's pick the one where they mentioned my music.
我不想让别人觉得我在想，让我们选一个他们提到我的音乐的吧。

00:57:24.500 --> 00:57:25.340
Oh.
哦。

00:57:25.340 --> 00:57:26.929
Ha ha ha.
哈哈哈。

00:57:26.929 --> 00:57:29.340
I am guilty.
我有罪。

00:57:29.340 --> 00:57:31.219
Please equip me.
请装备我。

00:57:31.219 --> 00:57:33.579
All sins off again.
一切罪孽再次消散。

00:57:33.579 --> 00:57:36.059
New York City!
纽约市！

