The real question, it just hit me.
真正的问题，它刚刚击中了我。

00:59:02.443 --> 00:59:08.789
Am I in love with you or just new York City?
我爱的是你还是只爱纽约市？

00:59:08.789 --> 00:59:13.190
Well, Craig, thank you for chatting with me, my friend.
好吧，克雷格，谢谢你和我聊天，我的朋友。

00:59:13.190 --> 00:59:14.212
Oh, this is a delay.
噢，这就是延迟。

